  "d3_vs_d6": {
    "question": "does applying D3 (drop saturated units) make D6 unnecessary?",
    "setup": "S4's 7 units are exactly the saturated ones (real AUC = 1.0000, sd = 0.0000), i.e. the units D3 would discard. If D3 subsumed D6, there would be nothing left to measure on them. But the question S4 asks is whether camera motion degrades them -- which requires measuring ON those units.",
